# The generated vendor tree is ignored by the repo-root .gitignore, and git does
# not descend into an excluded directory to honour these — they exist for
# reindeer, which skips gitignored paths when it globs crate sources and would
# otherwise find no `extra_srcs` at all. Its matchers apply root-first, so the
# un-ignore here is the verdict buckify sees.
!/vendor/**
